# T21 — Agent harness seam: COMPLETE

## Files owned and changed (only these staged/committed)
- `src/harness/types.ts` (new): `AgentHarness` interface + `AgentHarnessName`.
  Members: `name`, `egressHosts` (feeds Sandbox.allowedHosts in T5),
  `buildConfig`, `buildArgv`, `parseEvent`.
- `src/harness/opencode.ts` (new): `OpenCodeHarness implements AgentHarness`
  plus the moved-verbatim `buildOpencodeConfig`, `buildOpencodeArgv`,
  `parseOpencodeEvent`, `OpenCodeEventError`, `OpenCodeErrorEvent`, and the
  `opencodeHarness` singleton default.
- `src/runtime.ts` (refactor): `SandboxRuntimeAdapter` takes
  `constructor(harness: AgentHarness = opencodeHarness)` and dispatches only
  config/argv/event-parsing through it; clone → configure → run → collect,
  progress fractions, container env, and result envelope untouched. Legacy
  names re-exported so `test/runtime.test.ts` imports keep working.
- `.build/status/t21.done` (this file).

## No-behavior-change evidence
- Moved functions are byte-identical logic; `runtime.ts` call sites changed
  from `buildOpencodeConfig(input)` → `this.harness.buildConfig(input)`,
  `buildOpencodeArgv(input, workdir)` → `this.harness.buildArgv(input, workdir)`,
  `parseOpencodeEvent(line)` → `harness.parseEvent(line)`,
  `OpenCodeErrorEvent` → aliased import of the same class.
- Interface shape note: the PLAN sketch shows `buildConfig → {path,contents}`
  and `parseEvent → ProgressEvent`. Kept the narrower existing shapes instead
  (runtime owns the sandboxId-derived config path and the emitted-count-derived
  fraction), documented in `src/harness/types.ts`. Byte-identical output
  (the P5 success criterion) outranks the sketch; T22 can widen the seam.

## Verification
- `npx eslint src/runtime.ts src/harness/types.ts src/harness/opencode.ts` → clean.
- `npx vitest run test/runtime.test.ts test/opencode-input.test.ts
  test/transcript.test.ts test/opencode-agent.test.ts` → 4 files, 76/76 pass.
- `npx vitest run` (full) → 199/202 pass. The 3 failures are all in
  `test/runs.test.ts` ("refuses a fourth concurrent run" et al): the T2
  workstream bumped `src/runs.ts` MAX_CONCURRENT_RUNS 3→5 while the tests
  still assert 3. Pre-existing cross-agent conflict, untouched by T21
  (T21 touches neither `src/runs.ts` nor `test/runs.ts`).
- `npx tsc --noEmit` → errors only in `src/sandbox.ts` (T11 `override`) and
  `test/runtime.test.ts` getAgentByName arity — both from concurrent
  workstreams, none in `src/runtime.ts` or `src/harness/*`.
- Untouched as required: wrangler.jsonc, package.json, Dockerfile.

## Test command
- `npx vitest run test/runtime.test.ts`
